    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 This dragon guards the southeastern shore of the river in the Forest of Mirrors. Once a ghost in the Forest, he begged the Shaman Isir to restore his life. Resurrected as a dragon, he was ordered by Isir to prevent any outsiders from crossing the river and penetrating the Forest. Dragons Lv. 10 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Dragons. P. Def. +5% Max HP +5% Attack Range +30 Resistance to Hold +15% Resistance to Bow +10% Resistance to Crossbow +10% M. Def. -5% Resistance to Sword -10% Resistance to Dual Sword -10% Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
